[en.FOCUS_C12_REJUVENATION_OF_TOWNS]
Rejuvenation of Towns

[en.FOCUS_C12_REJUVENATION_OF_TOWNS_desc]
Although we embarked on industrialization two years ago, it came to a halt for various reasons. Now, the autonomous territory has a fresh start and will usher in a new spring.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_REJUVENATION_OF_TOWNS]
城镇复兴

[zh.FOCUS_C12_REJUVENATION_OF_TOWNS_desc]
虽然我们于两年前就展开了工业化，但是出于各种原因停滞了下来，如今的自治领有了一个新的开始，将迎来新的春天。

